<title>USA: U.S. stocks mostly higher at open.</title>
<headline>U.S. stocks mostly higher at open.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-06-10</dateline>
<text>
<p>Wall Street stocks opened mixed on Tuesday, with blue chips extending their recent rally and tech stocks starting slightly lower.</p>
<p>-- Dow Industrials .DJI up 18 at 7497.</p>
<p>-- Nasdaq Composite .IXIC off two at 1410.</p>
<p>-- S&amp;P Index .SPX up one at 864.</p>
<p>-- NYSE advance/decline .AD.N 383/307.</p>
<p>-- Nasdaq advance/decline .AD.O 822/739.</p>
<p>-- The 30-year long bond up 9/32 to yield 6.80 percent.</p>
<p>((-- Wall Street desk, 212-859-1737))</p>
